# API (`apps/api`)

Bun-native server. Do not add Node, `@hono/node-server`, Express, or CORS.

```ts
// ✅ src/index.ts
const app = new Hono();
app.route("/", healthRoutes);

export default {
  port: Number(process.env.API_PORT ?? 3000),
  hostname: "0.0.0.0",
  fetch: app.fetch,
};
```

- One Hono app per route file (`new Hono()`), then `app.route("/", …)`.
- Validate responses (and later inputs) with `@agentic-kanban/schemas`.
- Database access only through `@agentic-kanban/db`. Never import
  `@libsql/client` or `drizzle-orm` from the API.
- `src/auth/index.ts` and `src/realtime/index.ts` stay placeholders until a
  session asks. Realtime must stay in this process (SSE or WebSocket). No
  Socket.IO, Redis, or extra service.
- Future Better Auth: `drizzleAdapter` + `provider: "sqlite"` on this libSQL.
  No fake auth.
- Dev: `bun run --hot`. Listen `0.0.0.0:${API_PORT:-3000}`.
